{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答言：僧集和合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有即遣出，答言：未受具戒者已\n\n出。無，答言：無未受具戒者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有依法說。無，答言：無說欲\n及清淨者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有依請具。答，無，答言：此處無尼來請教誡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答言：說戒羯磨"}
